  "situation": "SOCNORTH is a TSOC in the NORTHCOM AOR, whose environment differs from the AORs of other TSOCs. Its role is being considered within constitutional constraints and alongside domestic and international partners with different responsibilities and rules. The available conceptions include a conventional military-command model and a framework for cooperative action with partners. Under the latter conception, SOCNORTH could complement partner efforts, support DOD efforts, and lead DOD efforts when appropriate. The Commander must define SOCNORTH’s role and approach.",
  "question": "What should the SOCNORTH Commander do to define SOCNORTH’s role as a TSOC?",
  "facts": [
    {
      "id": "F1",
      "kind": "situation",
      "status": "confirmed",
      "fact": "In September 2016, the SOCNORTH Commander sponsored a design inquiry.",
